		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Bonjour,<br />Il m&#039;est difficile à comprendre.<br />Le service Windows ne tourne pas.<br />Voir ici:<br /><a href="http://exercice-d-ecriture.blogspot.fr/" rel="nofollow">http://exercice-d-ecriture.blogspot.fr/</a></p><p>Mais je peux me connecter:</p><div class="codebox"><pre><code>C:\Users\Administrateur&gt;psql postgres
Null display is &quot;NULL&quot;.
Timing is on.
psql (9.6.6)
Type &quot;help&quot; for help.

Administrateur@postgres=# \l
                                         List of databases
   Name    |  Owner   | Encoding |      Collate       |       Ctype        |   Access privileges
-----------+----------+----------+--------------------+--------------------+-----------------------
 cave      | postgres | UTF8     | French_France.1252 | French_France.1252 | =T/postgres          +
           |          |          |                    |                    | postgres=CTc/postgres+
           |          |          |                    |                    | user2=c/postgres
 cave3     | postgres | UTF8     | French_France.1252 | French_France.1252 |
 cave_old  | postgres | UTF8     | French_France.1252 | French_France.1252 |
 cave_test | postgres | UTF8     | French_France.1252 | French_France.1252 |</code></pre></div><p>Merci pour l&#039;explication.</p>]]></content>
